      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Job dr_models_failover (action=failback). MANUAL, runs in EAST as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17). While WEST was primary it accumulated changes; reverse CDC pulls WEST->EAST via scope dr_remote_west. After assess_replication confirms parity, flips dr_state.active_primary = east.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job dr_models_failover (action=failback). MANUAL, runs in EAST as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17). While WEST was primary it accumulated changes; reverse CDC pulls WEST->EAST via scope dr_remote_west. After assess_replication confirms parity, flips dr_state.active_primary = east.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 12
    },
