      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Job     : dr_models_failover   parameter action=failback\nCadence : MANUAL (after EAST recovers) -- never scheduled\nRuns in : EAST (home primary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nCommand : databricks bundle run dr_models_failover -t east -- --action failback\nDrill   : dr_models_drill_failback self-asserts the reverse path.\nNotify  : on_success AND on_failure -> ankita.darekar@databricks.com",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job     : dr_models_failover   parameter action=failback\nCadence : MANUAL (after EAST recovers) -- never scheduled\nRuns in : EAST (home primary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nCommand : databricks bundle run dr_models_failover -t east -- --action failback\nDrill   : dr_models_drill_failback self-asserts the reverse path.\nNotify  : on_success AND on_failure -> ankita.darekar@databricks.com",
