      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "# EAST job (destination now). Reverse direction: source = WEST.\nhost  = dbutils.secrets.get('dr_remote_west','host')   # https://fevm-krish-dr-fevm-us-west-2.cloud.databricks.com\ntoken = dbutils.secrets.get('dr_remote_west','token')  # WEST PAT, read on dr_poc.ml\nwith _ambient_identity(host, token):        # -> WEST\n    client = MlflowClient(registry_uri='databricks-uc')   # reads WEST\n# NOTE: dr_remote_west lives in EAST (mirror of dr_remote_east in WEST).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
